    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Michael Pigott Auctioneer & Valuer is delighted to present for sale this lovely 3 bedroom semi-detached property situated in a prime & mature residential area in Farranree. \r\n\r\nThe property occupies a corner plot which offers lots of space especially to the front with a spacious enclosed front garden with secure off street parking. To the rear, it has an enclosed raised decking area along with side access via a pedestrian gate. While, the house itself does require upgrading and modernization throughout, it offers tremendous potential for someone to acquire and put their own stamp and taste in becoming a perfect home in a super location in the northside of Cork City. \r\n\r\nThe property is most conveniently located just minutes to the City Centre and is within walking distance to all amenities and services available locally. It has easy access to regular public bus service and has easy access to the North Ring road network. It is also just minutes to Blackpool Shopping Centre, Blackpool Retail Park and is just minutes to Apple, one of Cork's major employers.\r\n\r\nViewing comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 1.9m x 3.62m \r\nPVC front door with glazing, wooden floor, carpet stairway, timber cladding, cenrte light.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 4.47m x 2.82m \r\nWooden floor, open fireplace with wooden mantle, centre light, built-in storage unit, TV point. \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining - 3.13m x 2.63m \r\nVinyl floor, centre fluorescent light, under stair storage, plumbed for washing machine, fitted units, door to rear garden. \r\n\r\nBathroom - 1.74m x 1.59m \r\nFully tiled wall and floor, WC, WHB, bath unit with overhead electric shower, centre globe light. \r\n\r\nFIRST FLOOR - \r\n\r\n\r\nLanding Area - \r\nCarpet floor, cenrte light. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.86m x 2.63m \r\nWooden floor, built-in storage press, spotlights. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 2.14m x 2.62m \r\nWooden floor, spotlights. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 3.59m x 2.6m \r\nWooden floor, spotlights, built-in wardrobe unit. \r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Size: 61.1 sq metres (658 sq ft) \r\nGas Fired Central Heating\r\nPrivate enclosed rear garden with side access\r\nSpacious front garden and driveway with secure enclosed parking\r\nWithin walking distance to a host of local amenities & services\r\nEasy access to all routes, regular bus service to City Centre\r\n2 minutes to Blackpool Shopping Centre & Retail Park\r\nEasy access onto North Ring Road"
      },
